WEBVTT

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:06.200
July, 1945

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:09.210
Aegean Sea

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:37.700
Duchy of Romagna, Sicily

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:47.560
Duchy of Romagna Air Force

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:47.560
Pilot Officer Francesca Lucchini

00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:47.560
Sour!

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:53.150
United States of Liberion Army Air Force

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:53.150
Flight Lieutenant Charlotte E. Yaegar

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:53.150
Alright, that should do it.

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:56.460
OK!

00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:59.410
Nice! I wanna ride!

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:01.950
Sure! It just needs to be cleaned up, first.

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:04.000
Good job Shirley!

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.630
Franca! Shirley-san! Time to eat!

00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:10.750
Alright!

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:21.260
Food! Food Glorious food!

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:21.260
It's tough without a man around
the house. Thanks for your help.

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:24.520
Likewise, thanks for giving me a place to stay.

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:27.520
I have something really special today.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:30.650
My <i>zuppa di pesce</i>, it's made with shrimp and clams.

00:01:31.850 --> 00:01:34.440
I love mama's <i>zuppa</i>!

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:37.080
Oh, seafood?

00:01:39.210 --> 00:01:42.360
Try it, you might just like it, you know.

00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:44.900
I'll help myself, then!

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:47.420
Tasty!

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:49.750
It's really delicious!

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:53.190
Not it!

00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:54.810
I'll get it.

00:01:58.330 --> 00:02:00.520
Hey, this is Shirl'.

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:06.270
Huh? African Army headquarters? What do you need?

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:09.350
The neuroi captured an island? Delos?

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:12.230
Delos?

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.330
Neuroi...

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:16.860
On Delos?

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:38.480
That day when I held up my hand

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:41.610
And saw a far-away light

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:41.270
Erica Hartmann

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:41.270
Minna-Dietlinde Wilcke

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:43.750
Piercing between my fingers

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:46.750
I swore to the sky

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:46.860
Charlotte E. Yeager

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:46.860
Francesca Lucchini

00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:49.790
I'd cut through this storm

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:52.730
Faster than the speed of sound

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:52.570
Lynette Bishop

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:52.570
Perrine H. Closterman

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:54.980
On magic wings

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:58.220
To protect your smile

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:58.160
Sanya V. Litvyak

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:58.160
Eila Ilmatar Juutilainen

00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:00.980
Painfully, I start to cry

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:03.810
But you come to my side again

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:06.670
I absolutely will not give up

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:10.700
This blue, blue place

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:10.820
Sakamoto Mio

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:13.990
"Come on, let's fly!"

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:19.090
If I could fly I'd shield you with

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:20.880
My overflowing courage

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:24.120
And I would shake off

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:26.390
The approaching dark

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:30.630
Stronger than yesterday

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:32.820
I will head into

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:40.560
That familiar, sparkling sky

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:36.950
Miyafuji Yoshika

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:55.210
Goddess of the Aegean Sea

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:00.090
Well then, ma'am,

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:03.680
Please take care of my bike and luggage for a bit.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:04.840
Don't worry about it.

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.370
We're off.

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:08.360
Don't get into too much trouble, you hear?

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:09.220
Yeah.

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:10.950
Will do.

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:11.850
Launching!

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:39.110
Hey, wait up Lucchini!

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:40.690
What's got you so worked up?

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:42.510
It's Delos! Delos!

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:45.430
Huh? That island the neuroi's on?

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:49.560
That's where papa and mama and
I went on our first vacation.

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:51.920
Eh? Really?

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:54.300
Papa is coming back home soon,

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:57.860
And he promised we'd go there together again.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:00.940
Your father's in the navy, right?

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.100
Yeah...

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:05.200
He hasn't come back home in a long time.

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:08.160
I see...

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:09.350
Alright!

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:11.680
Let's go set things straight!

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:12.700
Yeah!

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:16.500
Hey Lucchini! Not that way!

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:17.400
Huh?

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:18.770
It's this way!

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:21.850
Eh? Where are you going?

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:28.340
Mediterranean Joint Force Headquarters, Crete Base

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:32.400
Hey, why can't we just go straight to Delos?

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:35.340
I would, but this order comes straight from the top.

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:39.980
Come on, the two of us could beat it, like <i>bam pow</i>.

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:44.760
Honestly, why do we have to team up with another squadron?

00:05:44.270 --> 00:05:47.560
Imperial Government of Karlsland Air Force

00:05:44.270 --> 00:05:47.560
Pilot Officer Raisa Pöttgen

00:05:44.270 --> 00:05:47.560
Imperial Government of Karlsland Air Force

00:05:44.270 --> 00:05:47.560
Flight Lieutenant Hanna-Justina Marseille

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:47.560
It was a direct order, please bear with it.

00:05:48.310 --> 00:05:49.330
It's Mar-something!

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:50.200
Africa?

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:51.220
Huh?

00:05:51.220 --> 00:05:52.240
Oh!

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:54.100
You two, huh?

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:57.080
Happy to see you, too.

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:58.860
Long time no see.

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:00.060
<i>Achtung.</i>

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:11.930
And I thought you didn't have any respect for authority.

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:13.510
S-Shut it.

00:06:13.950 --> 00:06:15.770
It appears everyone is present.

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:18.300
We will be going over the operation.

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:19.760
Imperial Government of Karlsland Air Force

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:19.760
Colonel Edytha Neumann

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:20.020
I'm Colonel Edytha Neumann.

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:25.030
And I'm commander of the African forces, Ernst Rommel.

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:24.770
Imperial Government of Karlsland Army

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:24.770
Field Marshal Ernst Rommel

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:27.080
At ease.

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:31.160
First off, we want you to see this.

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:36.900
We came into contact with it one morning around this area.

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:37.910
That's Delos!

00:06:38.260 --> 00:06:39.190
Correct.

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:41.420
Our objective is Delos.

00:06:41.970 --> 00:06:45.990
Off the Balkan peninsula, it is an important, strategic position in the Aegean Sea

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:51.300
If we allow the neuroi to establish in the area, we will lose an important sea route.

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:58.450
We've attempted aerial and witch assaults, but it persistently remains in it's cave.

00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:02.580
Without leaving, it was able to fire an intense beam.

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:06.030
This is our target.

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:10.450
The Venezian armada is ready to attempt an attack.

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:13.060
But their artillery won't be effective.

00:07:13.060 --> 00:07:16.410
Which is why we won't be bombarding the neuroi,

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:19.120
We will be bombarding the island.

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:21.370
What do you mean?

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:27.050
You'll be tasked with drawing the neuroi's attention while the armada prepares its attack.

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:31.590
The island will be destroyed, and with it, the neuroi.

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:32.960
But you can't do that!

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:33.550
Lucchini...

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:36.060
"Can't do that," Miss?

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:40.710
Well, Delos has a lot of really important ruins!

00:07:40.710 --> 00:07:43.020
Like... Humanity's...

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:45.080
Humanity's Legacy, right?

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:45.650
Yeah, that!

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:48.310
True, those ruins are important.

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:51.900
But what's more important right now is protecting human lives.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:56.600
There's got to be another way!

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:59.580
We can take out the neuroi without destroying the island!

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:02.460
Well, what do you have in mind?

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.920
Well... That's....

00:08:08.220 --> 00:08:10.300
Don't just say whatever comes to your mind.

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:11.510
What was that?

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:12.180
Tina...

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:14.820
Oh, I get it, you're afraid.

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:15.510
What?!

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:20.770
So, the Star of Africa would rather have the navy fight her battles for her?

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:22.240
I'd rather what?!

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:24.020
Tina, calm down.

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.440
Don't tell me to calm down.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:26.280
Hey.

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:32.650
Surely...

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:38.550
We can't bring ourselves to destroy Humanity's Legacy,

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:40.540
Can we, Neumann-kun?

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:43.370
I am opposed to any changes to the plan.

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:47.250
But I value a lady's opinion in combat.

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:52.800
And compared to the ships' artillery, a witch would be able to attack with pinpoint accuracy.

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:53.760
Wahoo!

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:56.500
Am I not a lady?

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:00.770
Nevertheless, I'll give you one chance.

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:03.180
Proceed with the utmost caution.

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:04.640
Roger!

00:09:08.970 --> 00:09:12.320
Hey Shirley, will this really work?

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:13.730
I don't know,

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:17.820
But if we can hit it with these 250lb bombs,
then something's bound to happen.

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:20.410
Damn, why did it have to be us...

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:23.350
The original plan was fine anyway...

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:24.560
Well,

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:27.540
The sooner we defeat this neuroi the
sooner we can get back to Africa.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:28.670
There it is!

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:30.540
Delos!

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:32.670
Delos

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:34.960
So, what are we doing?

00:09:34.960 --> 00:09:40.180
You two get the neuroi's attention and when
he shows himself we'll hit him with these.

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:43.000
Huh? That's your plan?

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:46.270
With Shirley's speed it should be possible.

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:48.480
So I'm acting as a decoy...

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:49.750
Can I count on you?

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.120
Yeah, yeah.

00:09:58.320 --> 00:09:59.160
Break!

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:06.590
There, huh?

00:10:06.590 --> 00:10:08.830
Get out here, you damn mole!

00:10:13.060 --> 00:10:14.000
It's coming out!

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:16.470
Alright, let's go pay him a little visit!

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:17.590
Gotcha!

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:33.190
Now!

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:36.320
Eat this!

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:44.740
It can attack from there too?!

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:46.910
Tch, looks like we've failed.

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:51.040
It's over for now, let's withdraw!

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:54.300
No! We have to take it out now!

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:55.210
Hey! Lucchini!

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:06.080
Get off this island!

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:10.640
Lucchini!

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:17.140
Hey, are you alright?

00:11:17.140 --> 00:11:18.700
Are you an idiot?

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:20.610
We have to try again!

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:23.450
That's absurd, Lucchini-san.
We don't have enough firepower.

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:24.980
Shirley, please!

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:28.000
We can't, Lucchini. We've used up
too much of our magic already.

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:29.590
We need to retreat.

00:11:29.590 --> 00:11:31.500
Shirley...

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:35.550
Hey, let's go.

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:03.490
I know he's a formidable enemy,
but we'll get him next time.

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:06.040
But tomorrow they'll destroy the island!

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:09.750
I already told you your plan wouldn't work.

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:12.250
You just want to take over at the last minute!

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:16.750
Quit it! You had your chance, just be grateful.

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:17.670
Hey, Tina...

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:19.260
What was that, you bitch?

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:21.350
What are you gonna do, cowgirl?

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:22.760
Stop it...

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:25.440
It's fine...

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:26.760
Sorry...

00:12:27.520 --> 00:12:28.960
Lucchini...

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:33.120
Raisa, let's go wash up.

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:40.380
What's wrong?

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:43.530
It's nothing...

00:12:44.270 --> 00:12:46.780
Well, whatever happens, I'll be here for you.

00:12:56.760 --> 00:12:59.200
Man, baths are great.

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:04.040
There's nothing like this in Africa, is there?

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:06.300
You're late, what were you doing?

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:10.050
I talked with Lucchini-san for a bit.

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:12.080
I wonder why she's trying so hard...

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:15.640
Trying to understand the other squad, huh?

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:24.150
Do you want to know why I think
she's trying to protect that island?

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:26.680
And why's that?

00:13:27.520 --> 00:13:30.810
Do you remember when it was just the two of us in Africa?

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:32.010
Not at all.

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:35.160
It was pretty hectic back then.

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:36.790
Oh yeah...

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:41.160
Having a place to return to is nice, isn't it?

00:13:43.700 --> 00:13:49.050
And we would fight to defend that
place, no matter what, right?

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:54.060
And for her that's Delos, huh?

00:13:58.200 --> 00:13:59.770
I'm done.

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:05.740
I want your report of today.

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:07.450
C-Colonel Neumann!

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:11.450
I don't know how it works in Africa, but you
shouldn't act so uncouth around here.

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:14.170
Today's operation was a failure.

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:17.830
As such, we will go ahead with your plan tomorrow.

00:14:18.180 --> 00:14:23.400
I thought you were a first-rate witch
who could bring satisfactory results,

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:25.960
But maybe I overestimated you.

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:31.100
I want you to show me your best, tomorrow.

00:14:32.150 --> 00:14:35.190
I don't want the Star of Africa to
look like an embarrassment.

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:35.970
Roger.

00:14:40.580 --> 00:14:45.250
One time, I got a letter from my
father when I was on base.

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:51.740
He said that once he gets back that
we would all go to Delos together.

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:56.720
But, if the island is destroyed we can't go anymore, right?

00:14:57.380 --> 00:14:58.540
You know...

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:04.840
On the island, there was something
I really wanted to show you.

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:06.630
Show me?

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:08.690
But...

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:11.390
That's pointless now.

00:15:25.290 --> 00:15:30.370
<i>At 1350 hours, Lieutenant Yeager will fly ahead
and and grab the neuroi's attention.</i>

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:35.290
<i>Then, Lieutenant Marseille will join in and add covering fire.</i>

00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:36.160
<i>At 1400 hours, the armada will arrive at the
destination and begin the bombardment.</i>

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:40.130
At 1400 hours, the armada will arrive at the
destination and begin the bombardment.

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:42.580
<i>They will hold their positions
until the island is destroyed.</i>

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:47.880
<i>During this, Officers Lucchini and
Pöttgen will accompany the fleet.</i>

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:48.720
<i>Over and out.</i>

00:15:50.660 --> 00:15:51.880
Maybe...

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:54.090
Hey, what are you thinking?

00:15:54.090 --> 00:15:55.640
Maybe we can use that.

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:56.470
What?

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:01.330
Shirley... Good luck...

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:02.480
Knowing those two,

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:04.160
They'll be just fine.

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:05.370
Yeah.

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:14.480
Hey, we're ahead of schedule.

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:15.370
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:18.490
<i>That Liberion went flying off alone.</i>

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:19.430
What?!

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:22.660
<i>Lieutenant Yeager, turn back and regroup, now.</i>

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:25.400
<i>Marseille, go intercept Lieutenant Yeager.</i>

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:27.170
Dammit, what is she thinking?

00:16:28.640 --> 00:16:29.420
There!

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:32.170
That Liberty ship, we can use that!

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:36.510
It's here!

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:56.110
Liberion! Are you trying to get yourself killed?!

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:59.490
Sorry, but just trust me on this one!

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.910
A winch? Oh, I see!

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:05.370
Lieutenant Yeager, you're committing misconduct.

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:07.790
Request. I only need 10 minutes.

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:10.550
I won't give up on this!

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:12.710
Request denied. Return to your
position, Lieutenant Yeager.

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:14.140
<i>Request denied. Return to your
position, Lieutenant Yeager.</i>

00:17:15.940 --> 00:17:19.620
Commander Neumann, there are still 5 minutes
before the start of the operation.

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:20.470
Africa...

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:22.240
What are you doing, Marseille?!

00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:26.980
You wanted me to show you how a first-rate
witch works, right commander?

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:29.360
Thanks for the help, Africa!

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:33.610
This isn't for you, I have my own reasons.

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:36.010
Just follow the plan, you idiot!

00:17:36.010 --> 00:17:38.140
I see, a winch, huh?

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:39.970
Let's give them their time.

00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:40.740
General?!

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:46.000
Colonel Neumann, if the battle changes
then so should our strategy, right?

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:54.090
Same as last time!

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:57.510
Nice one!

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:01.600
Hurry up, it'll regenerate soon!

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:03.720
Alright, good to go!

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:16.740
No good, unless we hit the core it just regenerates!

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:23.450
Damn, the wire's slowing me down!

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:29.040
Lucchini?!

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:31.250
Support has arrived!

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:34.250
Her? And Raisa, you too?

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:35.920
General Rommel's orders.

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:38.840
Nice one, general!

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:41.060
Let's go, Shirley!

00:18:41.060 --> 00:18:41.720
Alright!

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:55.110
Over here, you damn mole!

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:22.170
Alright!

00:19:22.170 --> 00:19:23.140
Got it!

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:28.930
It's trying to attack the wire!

00:19:29.220 --> 00:19:31.310
We're almost there. Hurry up, Liberion!

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:55.500
It's working!

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:57.630
We've got him now!

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:03.470
What the?

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:07.830
Hey! What's happening?

00:20:07.830 --> 00:20:10.370
No good! The engine's dead!

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:11.140
What?!

00:20:11.530 --> 00:20:14.150
No... Not yet...

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:18.810
Dammit!

00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:34.800
Commander Rommel!

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:37.540
I think <i>this</i> should give us enough power.

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:39.070
Huh?

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:43.430
There, that should do it!

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:46.160
Amazing!

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:47.440
Good going, general!

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:52.400
It's still not enough power!

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:53.160
Grab it!

00:20:53.160 --> 00:20:53.850
Yeah!

00:20:54.360 --> 00:20:55.630
Ready, and...

00:20:55.630 --> 00:20:57.560
Come on!

00:20:57.920 --> 00:20:59.510
Lucchini-san, let's hold him off!

00:20:59.510 --> 00:21:00.230
Gotcha!

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:05.740
This is it!

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:11.870
We got it!

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:13.790
Now's our chance!

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:14.870
Open fire!

00:21:54.430 --> 00:21:56.940
We did it! We saved the island!

00:21:56.940 --> 00:21:58.240
We did it, Lucchini!

00:21:58.240 --> 00:22:00.170
Way to go, Shirley!

00:22:01.560 --> 00:22:03.170
We did it!

00:22:03.170 --> 00:22:05.420
I'm so glad!

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:12.060
Destruction of neuroi confirmed!

00:22:12.060 --> 00:22:14.160
Mission complete!

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:35.370
Humanity's Legacy, eh?

00:22:35.370 --> 00:22:37.080
Beautiful, isn't it?

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:39.290
Look Shirley!

00:22:39.290 --> 00:22:42.790
When I grow up, I want to be like this witch!

00:22:43.150 --> 00:22:45.320
It looks like Shirley-san, doesn't it?

00:22:47.110 --> 00:22:49.700
So this is what you wanted to show me...

00:22:51.920 --> 00:22:53.340
It's alright, I guess.

00:22:53.340 --> 00:22:53.810
Oh?

00:22:54.310 --> 00:22:57.310
And this one looks like Tina!

00:22:59.030 --> 00:23:01.130
It looks like mine is still bigger.

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:03.420
More like it's still saggier.

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:05.960
You're just jealous of my size.

00:23:05.960 --> 00:23:07.590
Oh yeah? Well...

00:23:06.920 --> 00:23:08.650
Thank you, everyone!

00:23:07.590 --> 00:23:08.650
That's what you—

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:14.560
Well, let's get going.

00:23:14.560 --> 00:23:16.750
Aw come on, just a little longer!

00:23:16.750 --> 00:23:19.260
I know! Let's take a picture!

00:23:19.260 --> 00:23:20.780
Yeah! Yeah!

00:23:39.680 --> 00:23:45.170
I feel a radiant light on my back

00:23:45.170 --> 00:23:50.840
And see dear scenes in front of me

00:23:50.840 --> 00:23:56.360
I hold out both my small hands

00:23:56.360 --> 00:24:01.940
And reach towards that large cloud

00:24:01.990 --> 00:24:07.410
No matter where we are in the world

00:24:07.560 --> 00:24:12.680
We can look up at the same sky

00:24:12.680 --> 00:24:21.060
I want to stay like this in your loving embrace

00:24:21.060 --> 00:24:23.530
Let's take off

00:24:21.060 --> 00:24:23.530
TAKE OFF

00:24:23.650 --> 00:24:26.990
Even if we might lose

00:24:26.990 --> 00:24:29.870
We'll stand strong until the end

00:24:29.870 --> 00:24:34.720
I will not give up the things that I hold dear

00:24:34.820 --> 00:24:38.160
I know I'm not alone

00:24:38.160 --> 00:24:41.070
Because I believe

00:24:41.070 --> 00:24:50.000
No matter where I go I can fly with you

00:24:54.660 --> 00:24:57.300
Did you get another letter from Europe, Yoshika-chan?

00:24:57.600 --> 00:25:00.920
Yeah, from Shirley-san and Lucchini-chan,

00:25:00.920 --> 00:25:03.160
But it's not from Europe.

00:25:03.160 --> 00:25:05.310
Where is it from this time?

00:25:05.310 --> 00:25:08.450
Umm... From Tobruk.

00:25:08.450 --> 00:25:09.320
Where's that?

00:25:09.320 --> 00:25:11.480
Tobruk, in Africa?

00:25:11.480 --> 00:25:12.710
Yeah, that's right.

00:25:13.480 --> 00:25:16.850
That's where the Star of Africa is
from! She's an amazing witch!

00:25:16.850 --> 00:25:19.490
The Star of Africa, eh?

00:25:21.160 --> 00:25:24.390
It's gotta be her! She's so cool!

00:25:24.390 --> 00:25:27.500
Looks like they're having fun!

00:25:27.500 --> 00:25:30.500
To Be Continued

00:25:32.480 --> 00:25:36.800
Next time: Strike Witches
Operation Victory Arrow volume 3!

00:25:36.800 --> 00:25:38.360
Arnhem Bridge.

00:25:38.360 --> 00:25:40.810
Featuring Perrine-san and Lynne-chan!

00:25:40.810 --> 00:25:42.260
Please look forward to it!
